From 296a96b6d9764df04d012340e157280f5d6fe13b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GeminiWolf <GeminiWolf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:18:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Polish CineWolf: titles, hero data, TV backdrop, search,
 404, skeletons, nav

- Per-page metadata with "%s | CineWolf" template; detail pages use TMDB name
- Hero shows genre names and vote_average instead of genre IDs/popularity
- Detail backdrop uses w1280 with poster/gradient fallback; fix fill images on TV page
- Top padding on /movies and /series so headings clear the fixed nav
- Debounced live search with empty state
- Branded 404 page
- Higher-contrast, larger card metadata; NR for unrated
- Skeleton placeholders replace loading text
- Active-page highlight in nav; logo renamed CineWolf and links home
- Footer: real Movies/TV Shows/Home links, dead links removed, TMDB attribution
